OL,3,GNEWSAUnder-fire ambulance service
OL,4,Aimproves in ratings
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn ambulance service formerly rated as
OL,7,Fthe worst in the country by the NHS has
OL,8,Fnow had several parts of its service
OL,9,Frated as good by the Care Quality
OL,10,FCommission (CQC).
OL,12,FSouth Western Ambulance Service Trust's
OL,13,F(SWAST) emergency and urgent care,
OL,14,Femergency operations, resilience,
OL,15,Furgent care and patient transport
OL,16,Fservices were inspected by the CQC
OL,17,Fbetween April and July.
OL,19,FIn December the trust was rated lowest
OL,20,Fin the country by the NHS Oversight
OL,21,FFramework.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
