OL,3,GNEWSAUnder-fire ambulance service
OL,4,Aimproves in ratings
OL,5,
OL,6,FCatherine Campbell, from the CQC, said:
OL,7,F"We found people were receiving safe
OL,8,Fand effective care across the board."
